//youtu.be/mQgoPZOVY-A","type":1,"difficulty":"Medium","parentId":null,"answers":[{"id":52288,"text":"<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi></math></p>","image":"","correct":false,"solution":""},{"id":52289,"text":"<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></math></p>","image":"","correct":false,"solution":""},{"id":52290,"text":"<p>1</p>","image":"","correct":true,"solution":""},{"id":52291,"text":"<p>-1</p>","image":"","correct":false,"solution":""}]},{"id":13519,"text":"<p>If a and b are real numbers, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi></math>&nbsp;then what is the value of a + b?</p>","code":"BQC12-0011E","image":"","video":"https://youtu.be/vaA63OnOQIE","type":1,"difficulty":"Easy","parentId":null,"answers":[{"id":52296,"text":"<p>12</p>","image":"","correct":true,"solution":""},{"id":52297,"text":"<p>-6</p>","image":"","correct":false,"solution":""},{"id":52298,"text":"<p>6</p>","image":"","correct":false,"solution":""},{"id":52299,"text":"<p>21-6<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi></math></p>","image":"","correct":false,"solution":""}]},{"id":13521,"text":"<p>If z=3+ 4i, then |z|=?</p>","code":"BQC12-0012E","image":"","video":"https://youtu.be/IjejZzsu8yc","type":1,"difficulty":"Easy","parentId":null,"answers":[{"id":52304,"text":"<p>3</p>","image":"","correct":false,"solution":""},{"id":52305,"text":"<p>4</p>","image":"","correct":false,"solution":""},{"id":52306,"text":"<p>5</p>","image":"","correct":true,"solution":""},{"id":52307,"text":"<p>-5</p>","image":"","correct":false,"solution":""}]},{"id":13523,"